{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sickle","model_identifier":"sickle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sickle\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (1 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -9.5..1.5, z -13.5..2.5 (size 1.5 x 11.0 x 16.0 u = 4 x 31 x 45 cm).\nSickle (copper, bronze, iron grades, steel): short wooden grip, blade built from stepped cubes curving forward then down and back (one rotated tip cube). Grip at the origin, blade from 4.5 u to 13.5 u forward (-Z); the inner (cutting) edge faces back toward the user and down. One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: copper. Tier textures: copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sickle_copper.png`, `sickle_bronze.png`, `sickle_iron_bloom.png`, `sickle_iron_wrought.png`, `sickle_iron_refined.png`, `sickle_steel.png`, `sickle_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## sickle\n\nWorker tool, metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (1 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -9.5..1.5, z -13.5..2.5 (size 1.5 x 11.0 x 16.0 u = 4 x 31 x 45 cm).\nSickle (copper, bronze, iron grades, steel): short wooden grip, blade built from stepped cubes curving forward then down and back (one rotated tip cube). Grip at the origin, blade from 4.5 u to 13.5 u forward (-Z); the inner (cutting) edge faces back toward the user and down. One-handed.\n- Embedded texture: copper. Tier textures: copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sickle_copper.png`, `sickle_bronze.png`, `sickle_iron_bloom.png`, `sickle_iron_wrought.png`, `sickle_iron_refined.png`, `sickle_steel.png`, `sickle_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"grip","box_uv":false,"